[102.760172, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[1;30r\u001b[30;1H\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K\u001b[2m• \u001b[22mThe spec requires three authoritative Parquet datasets and several edge cases (duplicate inputs,\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  point/geometry resolution, buffered field matching, and tiered contact overrides). I’m now\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  profiling the input and checking which geospatial/Quarto components are available so the\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[102.760353, "o", "\u001b[39;49m\u001b[K  implementation stays both auditable and runnable.\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b[r\u001b[35;3H\u001b[32;19H\u001b[38;2;125;127;131;49m and dat\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[0 q\u001b[31;1H \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[0m\u001b[35;3H\u001b[?25h\u001b[?2026l"]
